DTSTAMP:20260806T111136Z
DTSTART:20260819T110000Z
DESCRIPTION:Join us for an engaging Lunch & Learn designed to bring local b
	usinesses\, organizations\, and professionals together for an afternoon of
	 networking\, education\, and collaboration. \nEnjoy a freshly prepared lu
	nch while learning about the exceptional meeting and event spaces availabl
	e at the Hilton Garden Inn Houston Energy Corridor. You’ll have the opport
	unity to tour our renovated hotel\, explore our flexible meeting venues\, 
	discover our catering options\, and learn how our experienced sales team c
	an help make your next meeting\, training session\, corporate event\, or s
	ocial gathering a success. \nWhether you’re an executive assistant\, meeti
	ng planner\, HR professional\, business owner\, nonprofit leader\, or even
	t organizer\, this event offers valuable ideas\, meaningful connections\, 
	and practical solutions for hosting successful events. \nWhat to Expect\n\
	nComplimentary chef-prepared lunch\nGuided tour of our meeting and event s
	paces\nNetworking with local professionals\nHotel and catering presentatio
	n\nEvent planning tips and ideas\nExclusive Lunch & Learn booking incentiv
	es\nQ&A with our Sales Team\n\nPerfect For\n\nCorporate Meeting Planners\n
	Executive Assistants\nOffice Managers\nHuman Resources Professionals\nEven
	t Planners\nNonprofit Organizations\nChurches\nTraining Coordinators\nSmal
	l Business Owners\nCommunity Organizations\n\nConnect. Learn. Network. Gro
	w. \nDiscover why the Hilton Garden Inn Houston Energy Corridor is the per
	fect destination for meetings\, trainings\, conferences\, celebrations\, a
	nd corporate events.\n\nhttps://energycorridor.org/event/hilton-garden-inn
	-energy-corridor-lunch-learn/\n\nFrom Energy Corridor Farmers Market
