UID:q0zQGdyrqoeeO7dmisbTr
SUMMARY:Empty Bowls Houston at The Market at River Oaks District
DTSTAMP:20260806T111136Z
DTSTART:20260823T110000Z
DESCRIPTION:Empty Bowls Houston will be at the The Market at River Oaks Dis
	trict\nSunday\, August 23 from 11 am to 3 pm at River Oaks District\, 4444
	 Westheimer\, 77027\nHappy summer\, friends! Empty Bowls Houston is happy 
	to announce that we will be “popping up” at one of Houston’s newest farmer
	s markets\, The Market at River Oaks District! We will have a selection of
	 bowls for sale and a live pottery demo on the potters’ wheel. Come shop f
	or farm-fresh goodies and other local food products and\, of course\, our 
	amazing bowls made by local artists to benefit Houston Food Bank!\n\nhttps
	://www.houstonfoodbank.org/upcomingevent/empty-bowls-houston-at-the-market
	-in-river-oaks/\n\nFrom Houston Food Bank
URL:https://www.houstonfoodbank.org/upcomingevent/empty-bowls-houston-at-th
