SUMMARY:National Food Bank Day
DTSTAMP:20260806T111136Z
DTSTART:20260904T000000Z
DESCRIPTION:September 4th is National Food Bank Day – a day dedicated to hi
	ghlighting the vital work food banks do across our nation to support those
	 in need. Food insecurity is a rising issue in our country\, but together 
	we can change that. Join the movement by volunteering\, donating\, or advo
	cating for food security.\n\nhttps://www.houstonfoodbank.org/upcomingevent
	/national-food-bank-day/\n\nFrom Houston Food Bank
URL:https://www.houstonfoodbank.org/upcomingevent/national-food-bank-day/
