IMAGE;VALUE=URI;DISPLAY=BADGE;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://hermannpark.org/wp
 -content/uploads/2025/08/P4060009-scaled.jpg
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://hermannpark.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/0
 8/P4060009-scaled.jpg
UID:U2wlPRN95f0gKxSAGXi7h
SUMMARY:Sound Bath with Daemein Smith (Prioritizing Peace)
DTSTAMP:20260806T111136Z
DTSTART:20260905T080000Z
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a peaceful morning experience in Hermann Park with 
	a free guided Sound Bath led by Daemein Smith of Prioritizing Peace. Set a
	gainst the natural beauty of the Tsuru Family Terrace in the Commons\, thi
	s immersive meditation experience uses sound and vibration to promote rela
	xation\, mindfulness\, and emotional well-being. Guests are encouraged to 
	slow down\, reset\, and “Prioritize Peace” through a calming journey of so
	und healing in nature. \n Tsuru Family Terrace\n Saturday\, September 5\n 
	8 – 9 a.m.\n Free Community Session \nGuests are encouraged to bring a yog
	a mat if available. Blankets and pillows are also recommended for addition
	al comfort. All ages and experience levels welcome. \nParking: Free parkin
	g available across the street from the Commons in Lot S (6215 Main St\, Ho
	uston\, TX 77030). Additional street parking available along Main Street.\
	n\nhttps://hermannpark.org/event/sound-bath-with-daemein-smith-prioritizin
	g-peace-11/\n\nFrom Hermann Park Conservancy
URL:https://hermannpark.org/event/sound-bath-with-daemein-smith-prioritizin
	g-peace-11/
LOCATION:The Commons
X-CALRIPPER-SOURCE:hermann-park
CATEGORIES:Hermann Park Conservancy
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
DURATION:PT1H
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
IMAGE;VALUE=URI;DISPLAY=BADGE;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://eadn-wc02-10923896
 .nxedge.io/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Tandem-Bikes.jpg
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://eadn-wc02-10923896.nxedge.io/wp-content/u
 ploads/2024/04/Tandem-Bikes.jpg
UID:15CqGSnDZmtbskRpGnoi8
SUMMARY:Monthly Tandem Bike Riding with Achilles International - September 
	2026
DTSTAMP:20260806T111136Z
DTSTART:20260905T080000Z
DESCRIPTION:Ride in Tandem – Inclusive Cycling with The Lighthouse and Achi
	lles International\nDon’t miss the thrill of our upcoming tandem bike ride
	 days! In partnership with Achilles International\, we’re bringing togethe
	r riders of all abilities for a fully inclusive tandem cycling workout\, f
	ollowed by a relaxed breakfast social to refuel and connect. \nWhere: Stud
	e Park – 1031 Stude Street\, Houston\, TX 77007 \nWhen: Usually the first 
	Saturday of every month\, 8:00–10:00 AM. Check our events calendar for exa
	ct dates. \nPLEASE NOTE: Attendees must register by 8:00 AM the Friday bef
	ore each bike ride. Contact Michaela for more information. \nWant to make 
	an even bigger impact? Volunteers are needed to help guide riders\, assist
	 with equipment\, and keep the event running smoothly. Whether you’re an e
	xperienced cyclist or just eager to lend a hand\, your support helps ensur
	e a safe\, fun\, and welcoming experience for all participants. \nFor more
	 details or to volunteer\, call 713-284-8424\, email youthadultservices@ho
	ustonlighthouse.org\, or visit the Achilles International Houston website.
	 \nREGISTER HERE. \n \n\nhttps://houstonlighthouse.org/event/monthly-tande
	m-bike-riding-with-achilles-international-september-2026/\n\nFrom Houston 
	Lighthouse
URL:https://houstonlighthouse.org/event/monthly-tandem-bike-riding-with-ach
	illes-international-september-2026/
LOCATION:Stude Park\, 1031 Stude Street\, Houston\, TX\, 77007
X-CALRIPPER-SOURCE:houston-lighthouse
CATEGORIES:Houston Lighthouse
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
DURATION:PT2H
END:VEVENT
